pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        Ch04
  - elementId: ev-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: ev-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        E1 / Foundational
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 36, 990, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 32
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Shelter: CCA 用户态隔离 — 内容摘要</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 80, 120, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 92, 1160, 590]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>用 Arm CCA 支持用户态隔离，把 Realm 能力从 VM 级机密计算推进到 user-space compartment。</p>
        <p>Shelter 是首个经同行评审的 CCA 用户态隔离系统，将原本仅服务于虚拟机的 Realm 机制扩展到应用级隔离边界。通过封装 CCA 原语，使应用 compartment 在不完全信任 OS/host 的前提下运行敏感逻辑。</p>
        <p>论文定位：开创/基础入口；材料类型：系统论文；证据等级：E1 / 基础证据。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        来源：Shelter: CCA 用户态隔离｜证据等级：E1 / Foundational
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
